        "UPCs": [
          "850060195839"
        ],
        "Description": "The 26 cc 4-in-1 Multi-Tool with LinkOn attachments is a versatile tool. With attachments such as a string trimmer, brush cutter, an articulating-head hedge trimmer, and a 10 in. pole saw all-in-one, it can serve many of your lawn needs. Add an edger to your combo for a complete multi-tool that does it all (edger attachment sold separately). This landscaping, tool-free, LinkOn attachment system is essential to your shed and saves space where it counts. Powered by a 26 CC, 2-cycle, full-crank engine, the multi-tool is designed for reliability. The full crankshaft engine starts easily and runs smooth, reducing emissions, increasing fuel efficiency, and delivering longer life. The transmission is supported by a vented aluminum casing which greatly increases engine life and reduces vibration allowing you to work in comfort until the job is done. This tool includes a support harness to increase control and stability. Notes about the product: This machine takes a mix of both gasoline and oil (sold separately).",
